WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.583
Primes are not a sumset.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:04.594
Could the primes, give or take a few,

3
00:00:04.594 --> 00:00:06.163
be all the sums from two sets?

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:10.922
If so, both sets look sparse mod

5
00:00:10.922 --> 00:00:13.045
every prime, which a new theorem forbids.

6
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:15.975
Claimed: no such pair exists.

7
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:19.032
Lean: main theorem.
